      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9169921875,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Specific feasibility challenges (training and infrastructure requirements, sample quality",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9549560546875,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "result interpretation system), general feasibility challenges (as identified in the interview",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        131.16119384765625,
        527.0300903320312,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "study and QES, respectively) and accumulated delays risk undoing the added value and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        146.66119384765625,
        527.0357666015625,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "benefits identified by the users (e.g. avoiding delays and drug-resistance information).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        162.34820556640625,
        257.6513977050781,
        175.2292022705078
      ],
      "text": "QES high confidence and interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.15382385253906,
        290.5672302246094,
        202.0678253173828
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention feasible to implement?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.0037841796875,
        78.81909942626953,
        226.14878845214844
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        213.0037841796875,
        527.2398681640625,
        226.14878845214844
      ],
      "text": "The feasibility of implementing the pyrazinamide LPA is challenged by the significant training",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        228.5037841796875,
        527.3037719726562,
        241.64878845214844
      ],
      "text": "and laboratory infrastructure required to implement this method. Feasibility also hinges on the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        244.0037841796875,
        526.9470825195312,
        257.1488037109375
      ],
      "text": "availability of an automated interpretation system, because the result is difficult to interpret.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969006538391113,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        259.6907958984375,
        134.57229614257812,
        272.57177734375
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.8500061035156,
        275.1541442871094,
        304.22998046875
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.98089599609375,
        527.1350708007812,
        326.12591552734375
      ],
      "text": "Factors to consider when implementing a high complexity hybridization-based NAAT for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.98089599609375,
        323.59832763671875,
        340.12591552734375
      ],
      "text": "detection of pyrazinamide resistance are as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.73291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        359.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        346.73291015625,
        526.9644165039062,
        359.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "There are specific concerns about the complexity and difficulty of interpretation. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        362.23291015625,
        526.9654541015625,
        375.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "large number of bands makes it difficult to read the result of the high complexity reverse",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        377.73291015625,
        216.85092163085938,
        390.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "hybridization-based NAAT.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.23291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        406.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        393.23291015625,
        526.9862060546875,
        406.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "Local epidemiological data on resistance prevalence should guide local testing algorithms,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        408.73291015625,
        495.44158935546875,
        421.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "whereas pretest probability is important for the clinical interpretation of test results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.23291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        437.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        424.23291015625,
        526.96435546875,
        437.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "The cost of a test varies, depending on the number of samples in a batch, staff time and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        439.73291015625,
        418.1578674316406,
        452.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "other parameters requiring a local costing exercise to be performed.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.23291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        468.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        455.23291015625,
        527.07568359375,
        468.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "Low, moderate, and high complexity tests have a successive increase in technical competency",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        470.73291015625,
        486.621826171875,
        483.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "needs (qualifications and skills) and staff time, impacting planning and budgeting.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.23291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        499.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        486.23291015625,
        527.0082397460938,
        499.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "Availability and timeliness of local support service and maintenance should be considered",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        501.73291015625,
        214.14480590820312,
        514.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "when selecting a provider.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        517.23291015625,
        78.81920623779297,
        530.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        517.23291015625,
        527.0855102539062,
        530.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "Laboratory accreditation and compliance with a robust quality management system",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        532.73291015625,
        524.419189453125,
        545.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "(including appropriate quality control) is essential for sustained service excellence and trust.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98288631439209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.23291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        561.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        548.23291015625,
        526.9642944335938,
        561.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "Training of both laboratory and clinical staff will ensure effective delivery of services and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        563.73291015625,
        157.24241638183594,
        576.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "clinical impact.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.23291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        592.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        579.23291015625,
        527.0913696289062,
        592.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "Use of connectivity solutions for communication of results is encouraged, to improve",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        594.73291015625,
        381.2862548828125,
        607.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "efficiency of service delivery and time to treatment initiation.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.23291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        623.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        610.23291015625,
        526.942138671875,
        623.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "Based on a multinational, population-based study, levels of pyrazinamide resistance varied",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        625.73291015625,
        527.0582885742188,
        638.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "widely in the surveyed settings (3.0–42.1%). In all settings, pyrazinamide resistance was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        641.23291015625,
        350.00250244140625,
        654.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "significantly associated with rifampicin resistance  . (49)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.73291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        669.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        656.73291015625,
        526.9423217773438,
        669.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "Implementation of a high complexity hybridization-based NAAT requires laboratories with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        672.23291015625,
        442.137939453125,
        685.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "the required infrastructure, space and functional sample referral systems.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.73291015625,
        78.81909942626953,
        700.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        687.73291015625,
        527.0501708984375,
        700.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "Because there are several manual steps involved, well-trained staff are needed to set up",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        703.23291015625,
        526.964111328125,
        716.3779296875
      ],
      "text": "assays and maintain instruments. Special training and experience are required for reading",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        718.73291015625,
        244.18521118164062,
        731.8779296875
      ],
      "text": "of banding patterns on the strip.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 99",
